      dealing: 'All cards dealt out equally to the players. Any remainder is stacked face up in the centre to begin the play pile. Each player holds their cards as a face-down deck.',
    },
    turnFlow: 'All cards are dealt out equally to the players; any remainder is stacked face up in the centre to start the play pile. Each player holds their cards as a face-down deck. Turn order is anti-clockwise, starting with the dealer. On your turn you reveal the top card of your deck and place it face up on the centre play pile. If your card matches the suit of the previous top card, you collect the entire play pile as your collected pile and get another turn immediately. If the suit does not match, your card stays on the pile and turn passes to the next player on your right. If your deck runs out you reshuffle your collected pile to form a new deck; if you have no collected pile you are eliminated. The last player left with all the cards wins.',
